cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite this repository and the exact commit used.
  This metadata describes an unreleased candidate, not a published v1.0.0 release.
type: software
title: City Flood MVP
abstract: >-
  A flood monitoring and decision-support demonstration using FastAPI,
  TimescaleDB, PostGIS and React. Includes deterministic synthetic scenarios,
  source and quality inspection, descriptive analysis of recorded NOAA rainfall,
  and disposable verification and recovery workflows. It does not establish
  calibrated flood prediction or municipal production readiness.
